#. i18n: file: src/irc/servergroupdialogui.ui:141
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KListWidget, m_serverLBox)
#: rc.cpp:1198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a list of IRC Servers in the network. When connecting to the "
